{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20260GHz7EasR31793081944.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>信置指，本港樓市基礎穩固，未來一年將推出近2,900個單位。</p><p></p><p>信和置業執行董事田兆源表示︰「我們看到在過去3個月，很多新樓盤都賣得很好，其中一手樓盤超過1,000宗，單說10月份到現在，我們還有5天時間，已超過1,700宗。因為人才策略、學生，各方面都令到住屋需求很強。我們本身未來都會有新樓盤推出，總共未來預期中，我們將有接近差不多2,900個單位推出市場。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T07:22:20.057298+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":181,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T06:16:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T03:18:22.007496+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T07:18:24.671103+00:00","content_hash":"084c807b1eeb1c0ccded333cd68a1f0f38c5e6744b0e1e2c924c3932bafe91b3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T07:22:20.057298+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}